  "result": "Excellent! All 156 tests pass. I've successfully added voucher support to invoices:\n\n\u2705 **Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code** to src/errors.js\n\n\u2705 **Updated invoiceTotals()** to include voucher:\n- Returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- Voucher is the fixed amount deducted (0 if no voucher)\n- Calculation: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher` (clamped at 0)\n\n\u2705 **Added applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })** function:\n- Validates status is 'draft' (error: NOT_DRAFT)\n- Checks one voucher per invoice (error: VOUCHER_EXISTS)\n- Validates amount is positive integer (error: AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Adds `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- Returns new invoice without mutating original\n\n\u2705 **10 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Adding single voucher to draft invoice\n- NOT_DRAFT protection (can't add to issued/paid invoices)\n- VOUCHER_EXISTS protection (one per invoice)\n- AMOUNT_INVALID for various invalid amounts (zero, negative, non-integer)\n- No mutations of original invoice\n- invoiceTotals with vouchers\n- Integration with discount + VAT calculations\n\nVouchers are now fully integrated\u2014applied after VAT, with proper total calculation and single-voucher-per-invoice enforcement.",
